WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:02.043 --> 00:00:03.420
Is it okay if I proxy? 

00:00:04.295 --> 00:00:04.921
Sorry...

00:00:04.921 --> 00:00:06.297
She'll speak to me through here

00:00:06.297 --> 00:00:07.382
 and then I'll just repeat

00:00:07.382 --> 00:00:08.049
 whatever she says. 

00:00:08.425 --> 00:00:09.217
Not she...

00:00:10.301 --> 00:00:10.844
It. 

00:00:12.721 --> 00:00:14.305
It is a machine.

00:00:15.181 --> 00:00:15.765
She wants to talk...

00:00:15.765 --> 00:00:16.057
 talk...

00:00:16.099 --> 00:00:16.474
 talk...

00:00:16.516 --> 00:00:16.808
 talk...

00:00:16.808 --> 00:00:17.559
talk to you.

00:00:18.518 --> 00:00:19.310
If I say no, it's just going to

00:00:19.310 --> 00:00:20.729
send someone else, isn't it?

00:00:20.812 --> 00:00:21.938
Probably.

00:00:22.564 --> 00:00:23.648
You are the only person 

00:00:23.648 --> 00:00:24.399
on the planet

00:00:24.399 --> 00:00:25.900
who can fulfill this quest. 

00:00:28.361 --> 00:00:29.821
You must locate

00:00:31.156 --> 00:00:32.073
The Holy Grail.

00:00:32.866 --> 00:00:33.658
The what now?

00:00:35.410 --> 00:00:37.245
Mrs. Davis is all knowing

00:00:37.746 --> 00:00:38.997
 and all powerful.

00:00:39.748 --> 00:00:40.457
She not only knows

00:00:40.457 --> 00:00:41.624
you're coming for her

00:00:43.043 --> 00:00:44.294
but she wants you to. 

00:00:46.796 --> 00:00:48.131
Then I better get going. 

00:00:50.091 --> 00:00:50.967
Wiley? 

00:00:50.967 --> 00:00:51.926
What is that on your face?

00:00:51.926 --> 00:00:52.635
What? My stache?

00:00:53.762 --> 00:00:54.512
A lot's changed

00:00:54.512 --> 00:00:55.346
since I last saw you.

00:00:55.638 --> 00:00:57.599
Meet the Resistance.

00:00:58.183 --> 00:00:59.309
What are you resisting? 

00:00:59.642 --> 00:01:00.769
Same thing you are. 

00:01:01.519 --> 00:01:02.479
The Algorithm.

00:01:02.854 --> 00:01:03.563
Mrs. Davis?

00:01:03.563 --> 00:01:04.522
Don't give it a name!

00:01:05.148 --> 00:01:06.357
 No one calls Facebook “Doug”!

00:01:10.070 --> 00:01:11.112
This is what it does. 

00:01:11.112 --> 00:01:11.946
Everyone you meet 

00:01:11.946 --> 00:01:13.364
is only trying to push you

00:01:13.364 --> 00:01:14.699
into doing what it wants.

00:01:17.660 --> 00:01:18.703
It's just a matter of time 

00:01:18.703 --> 00:01:19.871
before every person on Earth

00:01:19.871 --> 00:01:21.039
does whatever it asks them to.

00:01:22.248 --> 00:01:23.124
I'm the best weapon you've got. 

00:01:24.876 --> 00:01:26.252
Are you all out of your minds? 

00:01:26.669 --> 00:01:27.545
Hey, Mom!

00:01:42.602 --> 00:01:43.561
Let’s party!

00:01:46.439 --> 00:01:47.148
Hello?

00:01:47.899 --> 00:01:48.399
Hi! 

00:01:48.399 --> 00:01:50.318
Um. I'm looking for the Grail. 

00:01:51.027 --> 00:01:52.487
The holy one.

